# Final ranking file, line B (the bag line) of the submitted file: the base line of final.env (FORM=v99, through submissions/final.v99.parquet)
# with the seed bag of the rule-priced rows (unmatched LIRF and exposed) grown to 24 LightGBM + 16 CatBoost seeds (FZ_L / FZ_C, averaged
# 0.5 / 0.5). Its workspace is a copy of line A's after the members (scripts/run_final.sh stage bag); only its unmatched-LIRF and exposed rows
# enter the submitted file (scripts/assemble_final.sh F2).
